	Name:            DropEquipment

/* 
**      Copyright c 1993 ESCA Corporation  All rights reserved. 
** 
**      ESCA Corporation proprietary and trade secret information. 
**      Do not copy or disclose to third parties without written permission 
**      from an officer of ESCA Corporation. 
** 
**  Application:    CAC
**  Frame:          DropEquipment 
** 
**  Modification log: 
** 
**  Date:  	  Version       Description 
** -------------------------------------------------- 
**  JAN 93   	adl  		author  
**  02/09/93    em          Jobstatus parm added to Callproc
**  02/10/93    em          added stationground processing
**  02/11/93    em          only select groupings of type switch
**  02/12/93    em          all ground processing moved to drop
**                          equipment db procedure.
**  02/12/93    em          let updateallcardequipment drop current 
**                          jobs also
