/*
**  Application:    CAC
**  Class:          FMS_Card
**
**  Date:       Author   Description
** ----------------------------------
**  06/20/02    em       Added Insert Card method
**  07/11/02    em       Modifying Parameter list for card insertion
**  01/11/03    em       Added InsertAltCard Method to support ISO card
**                       and subfeeder card creation
**  01/18/03    em       Copied CardSOA.InsertCard method code in InsertAltCard
**                       - didn't know how else to call.
