**                     Looks funny when view Order Summary screen in FMSOnline
**                     where FOD and SSO orders are shown together.
**  01/15/04    em     Added Process Automation component call
**  02/04/04    ysp    SSO Interface Enhancement: Add order priority, objectives
**                     and bus configuration. The input Objective is kept in 
**                     case we'll use it for TOMS-RR interface.
**  03/04/04    em     Corrected Objectives array index out of bounds error 
