**               3. handle TLS requests.
**  06/15/10 ysp change the query of routes and feeders for a circuit.
**  07/19/10 ysp add Transmission Feeders outside substation requests and permits
**  08/24/10 ysp Add "CCTN & Other" filter.
**  09/08/11 ysp Set Openroad jurisdiction attribute (not in db) to show where the request is sitting
**  10/19/11 ysp In PermitIssuedNotification method, enhance the incoming message to indicate to the DO 
**               that it is necessary to create new TLS cards.
**  12/06/11 ysp Modify LoadISPList method to support both TO and SM
**  06/21/12 pkw Update StatusClause to use ISPStatus$CondApproved
**  07/02/12 ysp fix LoadISPList method. Note: not to always join the permit table with the request table. Some 
**               permits are created by TO and DO themselves and not from requests. 
**  07/16/12 ysp Add NotifyWhenCompleted column
