**                      inserts mulitiple log entries for shared jobs.  
**  01/15/03    em      To InsertControl and DeleteJob, add a call 
**                      to FMS_DeadMovesCount if a dead move and an FMS card.  
**  01/21/03    pkw     Auto-complete move when using issuesinglemove method.    
**  02/12/03    ysp     Load outstanding FMS moves into SLC.    
**  03/10/03    em      Include FeederAction parm to avoid feeder Job Actions
**                      when inserting outstanding move into other type of card.
**  01/16/04    ysp     FMS 293: load outstanding ground moves from job bank.
**  02/16/04    em      Convert Message to TraceError call
