**  03/23/05    em      Handle Steam Work Permit Number generation when inserting
**                      SDS permit control entry.
**  04/09/05    ysp     Set print id to blank when load outstanding job from drop bank
**                      for SLC.
**  11/16/05    em      Increased TOMove/RSMove length to 160 from 80; check 
**                      move length at insertjob time, if >80 it will be truncated
**                      so prefix with ##
**  12/16/05    em      Removed ## restriction since move text being increased to 160. 
**  02/03/06    em      In InsertControl method, if inserting a move that is a duplicate 
**                      of an existing move, where the existing move provides protection 
**                      to an outstanding permit, then set up to new move as a protection 
**                      move to the same permit.
**  03/28/06    ysp     Add Application as a parameter to method  LoadOutstandingMoves.
**  05/18/06    em      Don't insert duplicate protection link if new move is an N move.
**  03/15/07    ysp     Modified InsertJob method to allow ISP to be inserted with pre-defined job ID.
**  05/14/07    em      Modify InsertMove method to select Application from SOA_Card
**                      in support of proper ISWP substation heading insertion.     
**  05/18/07    em      Problem using same Job ID related to ISWP.  Add KeepJobID optional
**                      parm to pass through to InsertJob method. 
**  08/02/07    em      Insert Main heading for sole authority card with multiple mains.
**  08/29/07    em      Handle jobcontrol insert for common valve move.
**  09/05/07    em      Changes to LoadOutstandingMoves to support common valves in SDS.
**  09/14/07    em      Disable protection copy feature dated 02/03/06 when inserting ISWP conditions   
**  09/21/07    em      Include Steam when performing outstanding move job actions   
**  10/04/07    em      Removing additional headings on Steam card that separate by main   
**  07/02/08    em      Adding SpareBankBreakerPreload method
**  09/02/09    em      Incorporate card status in Insert Move method so that moves inserted
**                      into an open card are not cascaded.
**  09/29/09    em      Include Boxed valve moved in Load outstanding moves.
**  04/27/10    em      Change LoadOutstandingMoves for FMS to use SOA_ActiveObject to support3G
