**  10/02/14    ysp     Use SWPOutageReport class to handle swp updates. Not to link to SWP
**                      if the permit is not inserted on OSWPRequest or SWPDetails.
**  02/04/15    em      No StepHeading for DSO
**  03/04/15    em      Exclude equip None when inserting outstanding protection links for new moves
**  04/29/15    em      For DSO, Add StructurePG and StructureType attributes
