** 05/29/07  ysp    Fixed 4gl error by using SubstationName in trace message. 
** 12/18/07  em     When propagating shared equip moves to Sw Item, make
**                  sure we are not propagating to an Open Item.
** 04/04/08  em     Added "DISTINCT" to select that grabs shared moves for insertion
