**                    linked to a new RFP's locations because the new rfp has 
**                    the same requestforpermit and wplocation values as the old one.
**  12/14/05    ysp   Increase the size of tomove to 160 chars
**  01/09/06    ysp   FMS 350: If errors occur, reverse the Link, Unlink and Reject
**                    transaction.
**  05/09/06    ysp   Show equpment to be dropped or picked up from a RFP
**  04/16/07    ysp   ITC210: Insert IR interface event in DB event queue
**  05/07/08    em    When linking RFP to card, look for common Manholes and insert
**                    into Manhole RFP table if necessary.  Only necessary if card is CutOut.
**  09/15/10    em    Changes in support of 3G
**  05/21/11    em    Corrected common manhole query
**  07/27/16    ysp   Enable a 33kv portion card to access RFPs associated with the main feeder.
**  09/13/16    ysp   To support 33kv, remove sql clauses that limit permits on the current card
**                    when checking if there are permits linked to a RFP locations. 
**  12/14/16    ysp   Increase the length of RevisionComment to 1500
