**
**  Date:       Version Description
** ----------------------------------
**  11/20/98    pkw     modified fms version
**  05/21/99    em      add phase button
**  05/26/99    em      Determine here whether Phase button should be available
**                      rather than waiting for ReturnPhases to do the work.
**                      This way the button only gets highlighted when it
**                      is supposed to be available.
**  06/07/99    em      Enable Phases on Ground Move Restore
