**                      allow Phase button to be highlighted.
**  10/20/99    em      Don't allow Phases for NIS equipment.
**  04/03/00    em      Add Conditional Completion feature
**  05/04/00    em      Let JobChecks give the warning if takeout not completed.
**  06/23/00    em      Present warning if attempting to complete moves that
**                      were downloaded to an operating order.
**  07/06/00    em      Interface with completion of an OperatingOrder.
**                      Frame will be used to Confirm or Incomplete SOA Moves
**                      related to an operating order.  For completeness,
**                      all job actions will be performed using this screen.
**  11/06/00    em      Prior to all RETURN statements, set PhaseTerminal global
**                      to 0.  Used by Return Phases only.
**  03/12/01    my      Interface with completion of an OperatingOrder.
**                      Frame will be used to Confirm or Incomplete SOA moves
**                      related to an operating order. For completeness,
**                      all job actions will be performed using this screen.
**  03/15/01    my      Rescission Changes, On any Incomplete op order move,
**                      delete it from the ir_oporderjobs table.  (Disallow
**                      Undo for incompleted op order moves.)
**  03/28/01    em      Add automatic call to ReturnPhases if Returned Order
**                      Ground or Break move is not returned ALL.
**  01/14/02    em      Display Ground moves in red if ground is on when screen
**                      loaded or not in red if ground removed.
